<title>UK: LIFFE details Dec certified coffee stocks data.</title>
<headline>LIFFE details Dec certified coffee stocks data.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>LIFFE said on Wednesday that exchange-certified coffee stocks fell to 1,875 five-tonne lots in December from 2,104 in November.</p>
<p>Breakdown of stocks held in LIFFE-nominated warehouses as at last December 31 (in five-tonne lots):</p>
<p>    Ports		   December     November</p>
<p>    UK			    2	     4</p>
<p>    Rotterdam		  23	    35</p>
<p>    Amsterdam		 nil	   nil</p>
<p>    Hamburg		   118	   119</p>
<p>    Bremen		    119	   181</p>
<p>    Antwerp		   881	   837</p>
<p>    Le Harve		  345	   489</p>
<p>    Barcelona		  44	    60</p>
<p>    Trieste		     9	    27</p>
<p>    New York		  107	    88</p>
<p>    New Orleans	     227	   264</p>
<p>    Total		   1,875	 2,104</p>
<p>-- Jalil Hamid, London newsroom +44 171 542 4985</p>
</text>
